# Build context for the public web app: an allowlist, so runs/, .env, the spend ledger, the
# private data patterns and anything else on disk can't reach the image by accident.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements-web.txt
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!metalesionlab/
!public_data/
!dist/site_data/
!deploy/start.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
